# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TWITTER / X PROFILE LOOKUP
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# OPTION A — RapidAPI (Twitter v2 scraper, free tier available)
# Sign up at https://rapidapi.com/search/twitter
# Search for "Twitter API v2" by Aceritas or "Twitter135" — both work.
# Copy your RapidAPI key below.
#
RAPIDAPI_KEY=your_rapidapi_key_here
RAPIDAPI_HOST=twitter-api45.p.rapidapi.com
#
# OPTION B — Official Twitter/X API Bearer Token
# Create an app at https://developer.twitter.com
# Paste the Bearer Token from your app dashboard.
#
# TWITTER_BEARER_TOKEN=your_bearer_token_here
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The app will try OPTION A first, then fall back to OPTION B.
# If neither is set, it returns a graceful empty response.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
